---
description: Cursor hooks router (guardrails, not scripts)
alwaysApply: false
---

When the task involves hooks, guardrails, or approval gates, read `docs/hooks-and-guardrails.md` then apply:

- Zero-config: enable third-party Plugins/Skills in Cursor Settings → Rules, Skills, Subagents — `.claude/settings.json` hooks auto-load (PreToolUse→preToolUse mapping, exit 2 blocks).
- Native: copy `templates/cursor/hooks.json.example` → `.cursor/hooks.json` and `templates/claude/hooks/*.sh` → `.claude/hooks/` (`chmod +x`). Project hooks run from the repo root; cloud agents pick up `.cursor/hooks.json` automatically. Security hooks use `failClosed: true`.
- Never add human-approval prompts to Build hooks; gates (`production-gate.sh`, `RELEASE_APPROVAL`) live in Deploy.
